    - target: {fileID: 1725330892835322785, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Combat proceeds according to the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Turn
        Order Panel</color></font-weight> shown on the screen. Units act from left
        to right based on their Initiative stat. Higher <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Initiative</color></font-weight>
        means <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>acting earlier</color></font-weight>
        in the round. If two or more units have the same Initiative, their order
        is decided by a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>coin flip</color></font-weight>
        at the start of the round. \n

        The <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>currently
        active character</color></font-weight> is displayed in a <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>separate
        box to the left</color></font-weight> of the Turn Order Panel, making it
        clear whose turn it is at all times. You can click any unit in the turn order
        to select that character. Your Barbarian will take the first turn. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1741656935267957166, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
