    - target: {fileID: 3699915845686244086, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "This is the <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>Info Panel</color></font-weight>,
        here you\u2019ll find the character\u2019s name, class, traits, stats and
        all status effects currently affecting them.\\n\r\nEvery character has:\r\n
        \u2022 <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>One positive trait</color></font-weight>\r\n
        \u2022 <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>One negative trait</color></font-weight>\\n\r\nTraits
        can modify stats, alter {ability}ability{/ability} behavior, or introduce
        conditional effects.\\n\r\nClass-specific traits are more rare and often
        more powerful positive traits, shaping unique playstyles.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
