    - target: {fileID: 8521765745603833929, guid: 2256ce73421755a45912b2f2e87e9884,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Between combats, you may manage your party here.\\n\r\nYou can:\r\n
        \u2022 Recruit new characters\r\n \u2022 Sell existing ones\r\n \u2022 {heal}Heal{/heal}
        your party, you will get a free {heal}heal{/heal} now to try it out\r\n \u2022
        Inspect characters in detail via the Info Panel\\n\r\nCharacters offered
        in the shop are <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>generated with some randomness</color></font-weight>,
        meaning their <font-weight=800><color=#FFFFFF>stats and traits may vary</color></font-weight>.
        Keep an eye out for characters whose stats and traits best fit your current
        strategy. Striving to have a full party of characters as soon as possible
        is recommended."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
